@startuml a6-1-card-status
title A6. State-transition: Статусы карты (Card.status)

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
    BorderColor #999999
    ArrowColor #333333
}

[*] --> ACTIVE : создание карты

ACTIVE --> INACTIVE : patchCard / bulkUpdateStatus
INACTIVE --> ACTIVE : patchCard / bulkUpdateStatus

ACTIVE --> BLOCKED : patchCard / bulkUpdateStatus
BLOCKED --> ACTIVE : patchCard / bulkUpdateStatus

ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : patchCard / bulkUpdateStatus
EXPIRED --> ACTIVE : patchCard / bulkUpdateStatus

note right of EXPIRED
  Автоматического перехода по expiryDate нет.
  Статус меняется только явным вызовом patchCard / bulkUpdateStatus.
  Метод withData направление перехода не ограничивает.
end note

ACTIVE --> DELETED : deleteCard
INACTIVE --> DELETED : deleteCard
BLOCKED --> DELETED : deleteCard
EXPIRED --> DELETED : deleteCard

DELETED --> [*]
@enduml